{"body":{"text":["The session read the web chassis and components with a blank reader, and let go of the glue it could without the author's weighing: the chassis's test drawing with components of its own; the tokens and what the chassis itself makes given the chassis's look; links made in one place, as the page keeps its address, and no component reading the address; the breadcrumb one read of wholes and the start one of roots, functions written in the language; the components handing the chassis what it needs in one call, the chassis finding by type itself and giving no answer the same as the last; a picked component written strictly; a holon said in one read. A second reader's notes were mended, and 258 tests passed. It left for the author a card's summary written in the language, asking as state in the field, a card as a component, keeping what was shown done four ways, and the holon decoded in five places. The work was committed and pushed."]},"id":"1M83T7F6NKH4000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["The session built finding as the component spec has it, every argument matched: a native takes, giving what each placeholder of a function or a component takes of what is given as a use giving it would be judged, or null, written once in the evaluator; fitting, written in the language and stored in glass, the components that take what is given by a type of the field; and the chassis applying it over the components realized here, one found drawn, several chosen, none drawn by the fallback it is given, what holds no holon given it at once. The finder went from about a hundred lines that rebuilt the engine's lookup to about twenty. A blank reader's notes were taken: finding tied to what each placeholder took, is true for a holon alone, no legacy first. 258 tests passed and the page drew as before. The work was committed and pushed."]},"id":"1M84DMWQ1DZS000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
